  "notes": [
    {
      "id": "erzhu-feizi-p2-note0",
      "kind": "pei",
      "anchorText": "昭烈皇后。《诗》曰：『谷则异室，死则同穴。』",
      "original": "《礼》云：上古无合葬，中古后因时方有。",
      "sourceTitles": [
        "礼"
      ],
      "sourceIds": [
        "epub"
      ],
      "variants": [],
      "provenance": {
        "sourceId": "epub",
        "chapterPath": "OPS/c37_san_guo_zhi_juan34.xhtml",
        "paragraphIndex": 2,
        "blockIndex": 0,
        "bodyOffset": 271,
        "epubAnchor": "",
        "paragraphStart": 2,
        "paragraphEnd": 2
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "erzhu-feizi-p4-note0",
      "kind": "pei",
      "anchorText": "纳。瑁死，寡居。先主既定益州，而孙夫人还吴，",
      "original": "《汉晋春秋》云：先主入益州，吴遣迎孙夫人。夫人将太子归吴，诸葛亮使赵云勒兵断江留太子，乃得止。",
      "sourceTitles": [
        "汉晋春秋"
      ],
      "sourceIds": [
        "epub"
      ],
      "variants": [],
      "provenance": {
        "sourceId": "epub",
        "chapterPath": "OPS/c37_san_guo_zhi_juan34.xhtml",
        "paragraphIndex": 4,
        "blockIndex": 0,
        "bodyOffset": 86,
        "epubAnchor": "#mwt5",
        "paragraphStart": 4,
        "paragraphEnd": 4
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "erzhu-feizi-p4-note1",
      "kind": "pei",
      "anchorText": "其亲疏，何与晋文之于子圉乎？」于是纳为夫人。",
      "original": "习凿齿曰：夫婚姻，人伦之始，王化之本，匹夫犹不可以无礼，而况人君乎？晋文废礼行权，以济其业，故子犯曰，有求于人，必先从之，将夺其国，何有于妻，非无故而违礼教者也。今先主无权事之偪，而引前失以为譬，非导其君以尧、舜之道者。先主从之，过矣。",
      "sourceTitles": [],
      "sourceIds": [
        "epub"
      ],
      "variants": [],
      "provenance": {
        "sourceId": "epub",
        "chapterPath": "OPS/c37_san_guo_zhi_juan34.xhtml",
        "paragraphIndex": 4,
        "blockIndex": 1,
        "bodyOffset": 131,
        "epubAnchor": "#mwt6",
        "paragraphStart": 4,
        "paragraphEnd": 4
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "erzhu-feizi-p4-note2",
      "kind": "pei",
      "anchorText": "至车骑将军，封县侯。延熙八年，薨，合葬惠陵。",
      "original": "孙盛《蜀世谱》曰：壹孙乔，没李雄中三十年，不为雄屈也。",
      "sourceTitles": [
        "蜀世谱"
      ],
      "sourceIds": [
        "epub"
      ],
      "variants": [],
      "provenance": {
        "sourceId": "epub",
        "chapterPath": "OPS/c37_san_guo_zhi_juan34.xhtml",
        "paragraphIndex": 4,
        "blockIndex": 2,
        "bodyOffset": 251,
        "epubAnchor": "#mwt15",
        "paragraphStart": 4,
        "paragraphEnd": 4
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "erzhu-feizi-p6-note0",
      "kind": "pei",
      "anchorText": "，皇后其敬之哉！」咸熙元年，随后主迁于洛阳。",
      "original": "《汉晋春秋》曰：魏以蜀宫人赐诸将之无妻者，李昭仪曰：「我不能二三屈辱。」乃自杀。",
      "sourceTitles": [
        "汉晋春秋"
      ],
      "sourceIds": [
        "epub"
      ],
      "variants": [],
      "provenance": {
        "sourceId": "epub",
        "chapterPath": "OPS/c37_san_guo_zhi_juan34.xhtml",
        "paragraphIndex": 6,
        "blockIndex": 0,
        "bodyOffset": 111,
        "epubAnchor": "#mwt26",
        "paragraphStart": 6,
        "paragraphEnd": 6
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "erzhu-feizi-p9-note0",
      "kind": "pei",
      "anchorText": "咸熙元年正月，钟会作乱于成都，璇为乱兵所害。",
      "original": "孙盛《蜀世谱》曰：璇弟，瑶、琮、瓒、谌、恂、璩六人。蜀败，谌自杀，余皆内徙。值永嘉大乱，子孙绝灭。唯永孙玄奔蜀，李雄伪署安乐公以嗣禅后。永和三年讨李势，盛参戎行，见玄于成都也。 ",
      "sourceTitles": [
        "蜀世谱"
      ],
      "sourceIds": [
        "epub"
      ],
      "variants": [],
      "provenance": {
        "sourceId": "epub",
